  "description": "*\"It takes more to satisfy me.\"*\n\nDayoung has the looks, the talent, and the wealth to back everything up, but she desires only one thing - having her friend Jae-seung watch her as she embarks on her risque digressions. Whether it's in the library, on the school grounds, or at home, Dayoung calls Jae-seung whenever the mood strikes her. But how does Jae-seung feel about all this? Behind the thrill and the facade are the haunting traces of his past, ever so lasting as a burn.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
